---
---
<section class="install-section not-content">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="hdr">
      <div class="kicker"><span class="bar"></span><span>05 GET STARTED</span></div>
      <h2>Two files. Four minutes.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <article>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="badge">1</span>
          <h3>Write the trait</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Declare your plugin in a crate. #[istmo::plugin] desugars async fn into a wire-compatible trait plus Client and Host siblings.</p>
        <div class="codebox">
          <div class="head"><span class="lang">RUST</span><span class="file">crates/echo/ · lib.rs + istmo.toml</span></div>
          <pre><code><span class="c">// crates/echo/src/lib.rs</span>
<span class="a">#[istmo::plugin]</span>
<span class="k">pub trait</span> <span class="t">Echo</span> &#123;
    <span class="k">async fn</span> <span class="f">echo</span>(&<span class="k">self</span>, msg: <span class="t">String</span>) -&gt; <span class="t">String</span>;
&#125;

<span class="c">// build.rs</span>
<span class="k">fn</span> <span class="f">main</span>() &#123; istmo_build::<span class="f">emit</span>(); &#125;</code></pre>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="badge">2</span>
          <h3>Wire the runtime</h3>
        </div>
        <p>istmo::runtime! collects your plugins. istmo-build auto-generates Kotlin and Swift dispatchers for the Android and iOS projects.</p>
        <div class="codebox">
          <div class="head"><span class="lang">RUST</span><span class="file">myapp/src/lib.rs</span></div>
          <pre><code><span class="c">// in your app crate</span>
istmo::<span class="f">runtime</span>! &#123;
    plugins: [
        <span class="t">EchoClient</span>,
        <span class="t">DataStoreClient</span>,
    ],
&#125;;

<span class="c">// run it</span>
$ cargo build <span class="s">--target aarch64-linux-android</span></code></pre>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.install-section {
  background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
  padding: 5rem 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
}
.install-section .inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
.install-section .hdr { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
.install-section .kicker {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;
  font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.install-section .kicker .bar { width: 1.5rem; height: 2px; background: #bfff00; }
.install-section h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
  line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 0; color: var(--sl-color-white); font-weight: 700;
}
.install-section .steps {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem;
}
@media (max-width: 65rem) {
  .install-section .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
.install-section article {
  background: var(--sl-color-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 0.75rem;
  padding: 1.75rem;
}
.install-section .row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.install-section .badge {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  width: 1.75rem; height: 1.75rem; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--sl-color-white); color: var(--sl-color-bg);
  font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;
}
.install-section h3 {
  margin: 0; font-size: 1.35rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  font-weight: 600; color: var(--sl-color-white);
}
.install-section article > p {
  font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
}
.install-section .codebox {
  background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 0.5rem; padding: 1rem;
}
.install-section .head {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.install-section .lang {
  font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600;
  padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 3px;
  background: #1f1f1f; color: #8a8a85;
}
.install-section .file { font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: #6b6b6b; }
.install-section pre {
  margin: 0; font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem;
  line-height: 1.65; color: #f5f5f2; overflow-x: auto;
}
.install-section code { background: none; padding: 0; color: inherit; }
.install-section .k { color: #bfff00; }
.install-section .a { color: #bfff00; }
.install-section .t { color: #9db4d4; }
.install-section .f { color: #e8b9a3; }
.install-section .s { color: #a3be8c; }
.install-section .c { color: #6b6b6b; }
</style>
